  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>hyperbola: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>it passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfrac><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Now, equation of normal to hyperbola in point form</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfies the equation.</p>"
